                "Technical design (TSC level). GWM routes the infotainment temperature request from SOME/IP to the HVAC on BodyCan0.",
                "",
                "```mermaid",
                "flowchart LR",
                "  subgraph n_ClimateActuation[\"ClimateActuation\"]",
                "    n_ClimateActuation_GWM__8722707f[\"GWM<br/>(GWM_Climate)\"]",
